"en": "Greater Ice Crystal"
}
description = "放在法杖的装载槽上：法杖伤害 +{amount}，打出冰霜伤害，打中后给对手施加两层【寒冷】。凝霜：开战时先给对手两层【寒冷】。能供给 {max_charges} 场，用完就碎，碎了只能卖钱。"
descriptions = {
"en": "Set it in a staff's loading slot: staff Damage +{amount}, deals Ice damage, and each hit gives the opponent two stacks of Chill. Rime: at battle start, gives the opponent two stacks of Chill. Lasts {max_charges} battles, then shatters; a shattered one is only worth selling."
}
